Global notes:
Note (G1): Calculated by unweighted averaging the radial velocity of their
           member galaxies.
Note (G2): Based on the weighted averaged distance moduli of any members
           available in the Cosmicflows-3 (CF3; Tully+ 2016, J/AJ/152/50)
           distance catalog.
Note (G3): In recognition of systematics, a minimum to errors is set at 3%.
